            placeholder="ອະທິບາຍເອກະສານທີ່ຈະເກັບໃນຕູ້ນີ້..."
            className="w-full resize-none rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm outline-none focus:border-indigo-400"
          />
